        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Accordion Items -->
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-3.5">
        
        <div class="accordion-item rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-[#F7F5F0] overflow-hidden transition active shadow-sm">
          <button class="w-full p-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-900 focus:outline-none">
            <span>How can AAICA offer 30% to 40% lower prices than retail showrooms?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon text-xl text-[#ff1d25] transition transform">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Retail showrooms in malls pay heavy monthly commercial rents, multi-layer distributor cuts, and large marketing overheads. At AAICA, you deal directly with the factory owners (Arjun &amp; Ajay Ji). We own our automated workshop in Jagat Puri, buy raw plywood by the truckload directly from mills, and fabricate in-house. That entire 35–40% markup stays in your pocket.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-[#F7F5F0] overflow-hidden transition shadow-sm">
          <button class="w-full p-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-900 focus:outline-none">
            <span>What happens if water leaks under the sink? Will the wood swell?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon text-xl text-[#ff1d25] transition transform">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Under-sink cabinets are the #1 failure point in cheap kitchens. AAICA exclusively uses 100% IS:710 Boiling Water Proof (BWP) Marine Grade Plywood for all sink and carcass units. It can be submerged in boiling water for 72 hours without delaminating. Additionally, we line the sink base with an embossed PVC aluminum moisture tray for double safety.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-[#F7F5F0] overflow-hidden transition shadow-sm">
          <button class="w-full p-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-900 focus:outline-none">
            <span>How does the 45-day guaranteed handover work?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon text-xl text-[#ff1d25] transition transform">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Once your 3D CAD design and material selections are frozen, we issue a written handover agreement with a 45-day commitment date. Because all cutting and edge-banding happens in our own Jagat Puri factory (not outsourced), we have 100% control over timelines. On-site installation takes only 48 hours once pre-drilled units arrive at your home.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-[#F7F5F0] overflow-hidden transition shadow-sm">
          <button class="w-full p-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-900 focus:outline-none">
            <span>Can I visit your Jagat Puri factory before finalizing my order?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon text-xl text-[#ff1d25] transition transform">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Yes, we strongly encourage it! Our factory atelier is located at F-165, Jagat Puri Main Road, East Delhi. You can inspect raw plywood sheets, see our CNC cutting and edge-banding machines in action, test live Blum/Häfele drawer runners, and review physical acrylic and PU color swatches.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-[#F7F5F0] overflow-hidden transition shadow-sm">
          <button class="w-full p-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-900 focus:outline-none">
            <span>What is covered under the 10-Year Replacement Warranty?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon text-xl text-[#ff1d25] transition transform">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Our warranty covers delamination, termite damage, borer infestation, and structural warping on all 18mm IS:710 Marine Ply carcasses. Furthermore, all European motion hardware (Blum and Häfele hinges and tandem runners) carries a lifetime functional replacement warranty from the manufacturer.
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
